WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.640
Stop it!

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:19.060
Leave him! He's mine!

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:34.200
His own people shot him.
He's dying.

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:41.207
Why did you stop me from killing her?
Tell me while you're still alive.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.712
I didn't want them to kill you.
That's why.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:49.966
I'm not afraid to die. I'd do anything
to get you humans out of my forest.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.470
I knew that
from the first moment I saw you.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:57.015
And I'm not afraid of you!
I should kill you for saving her!

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.230
That woman is evil. There's no one
who can stop me from killing her.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:06.691
No. Live.

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:09.402
That's enough!
I'm not listening to you anymore!

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:13.865
You're beautiful.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:20.914
What is it, San?
Want me to crunch his face off?

